      "title": "From FIR to Supreme Court, cases will be completed in 3 years under new criminal laws: Amit Shah",
      "link": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/madhya-pradesh/after-full-implementation-of-bns-cases-from-fir-to-supreme-court-will-be-disposed-of-in-3-years-shah/article71540332.ece",
      "description": "Amit Shah, who heads the Home and Cooperation Ministries, said India’s criminal justice system was earlier known for delays, but the situation had improved",
